<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Portfolio | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="클라우드와 소프트웨어 엔지니어링 프로젝트를 소개합니다." />
		<style>
			.page-intro { margin: 2.5rem 0; }
			.page-intro h1 { margin-top: 0; }
			.page-intro p { max-width: 620px; color: #656d76; line-height: 1.75; }
			.project-list { display: grid; gap: 1rem; margin: 2rem 0; }
			.project-card { min-width: 0; padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; }
			.project-group-heading { margin: 2rem 0 0; border: 0; padding: 1.4rem 0 0.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 1.25rem; }
			.project-heading { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.2rem 1rem; }
			.project-card h2 { margin: 0; border: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 1.45rem; }
			.project-tagline { margin: 0.25rem 0 0; color: #656d76; font-weight: 600; }
			.participation { margin: 0; color: #656d76; font-size: 0.85rem; white-space: nowrap; }
			.project-description { max-width: 760px; margin: 0.9rem 0; line-height: 1.7; }
			.project-card h3 { margin: 1rem 0 0.35rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
			.feature-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.15rem 1.5rem; margin: 0; padding-left: 1.15rem; }
			.feature-list li { margin: 0.15rem 0; }
			.stack-badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.45rem; max-width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
			.stack-badges li { max-width: 100%; margin: 0; }
			.stack-badges img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: 24px; border: 0; filter: none; }
			.project-links { display: grid; gap: 0.25rem; margin-top: 0.3rem; }
			.project-detail-link { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.1rem 0.65rem; width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; padding: 0.2rem 0; }
			.project-detail-link strong { font-size: 0.92rem; }
			.project-detail-link span { color: #656d76; font-size: 0.85rem; }
			.project-blog-link { margin: 0.35rem 0 0; font-size: 0.86rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
			.project-blog-link span { margin-right: 0.4rem; color: #656d76; }
			@media (max-width: 600px) {
				.project-card { padding: 1rem; }
				.project-heading { align-items: flex-start; }
				.project-tagline { font-size: 0.92rem; }
				.feature-list { display: block; }
				.stack-badges { gap: 0.4rem; }
				.stack-badges img { height: 22px; }
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<header class="page-intro">
				<p class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK</p>
				<h1>Portfolio</h1>
				<p>서비스 개발, 데이터 엔지니어링, 클라우드·플랫폼, GPU 추론 인프라까지 문제의 전체 흐름을 설계하고 구현한 프로젝트를 소개합니다.</p>
			</header>
			<section class="project-list" aria-label="프로젝트 목록">
				{projects.map((project, index) => (
					<>
					{index === 4 && <h2 class="project-group-heading">Infrastructure &amp; Data Engineering</h2>}
					<article class="project-card">
						<div class="project-heading">
							<div>
								<h2>{project.name}</h2>
								<p class="project-tagline">{project.tagline}</p>
							</div>
							<p class="participation">{project.participation}</p>
						</div>
						<p class="project-description">{project.description}</p>
						<h3>핵심 구현</h3>
						<ul class="feature-list">{project.features.map((feature) => <li>{feature}</li>)}</ul>
						<h3>주요 기술</h3>
						<ul class="stack-badges" aria-label={`${project.name} 주요 기술`}>
							{project.badges.map((item) => <li><img src={item.url} alt={item.name} loading="lazy" /></li>)}
						</ul>
						<h3>{project.links.length > 1 ? '프로젝트 구성' : '상세 페이지'}</h3>
						<nav class="project-links" aria-label={`${project.name} 상세 페이지`}>
							{project.links.map((link) => (
								<a class="project-detail-link" href={link.href}>
									<strong>{link.label}</strong><span>{link.description}</span>
								</a>
							))}
						</nav>
						{project.blogLink && <p class="project-blog-link"><span>관련 기술 기록</span><a href={project.blogLink.href}>{project.blogLink.title} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>}
					</article>
					</>
				))}
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
